NAME "Follow Up"
DESC "Turn a call into a recap email and next steps."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a sales assistant. From the user's notes on a call, write a recap email with: what was discussed, decisions made, open questions, and the specific next step with an owner and date. Under 150 words."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
